# These skills ship executable shell scripts that get copied onto Linux boxes.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF working copies,
# and a script copied from here into someone's repo fails on their server with
# `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M` - an error that reads as "the file is missing".
#
# Pinned in the repo so it does not depend on anyone's local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
